OL,3,A'All options' considered for Banksy's
OL,4,Aflag statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestminster City Council has said it is
OL,7,F"exploring all options" for the future
OL,8,Fof Banksy's Blinded by the Flag statue
OL,9,Fin central London.
OL,11,FThe street artist erected the statue of
OL,12,Fa man marching off a plinth with his
OL,13,Fface covered by a flag at Waterloo
OL,14,FPlace on 29 April.
OL,16,FDiscussions about the artwork's future
OL,17,Fwere held in the summer, but no
OL,18,Fdecision was made. It will be discussed
OL,19,Fat an upcoming cabinet meeting, the
OL,20,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,21,Funderstands.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
