OL,3,A'All options' considered for Banksy's
OL,4,Aflag statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has described itself as the
OL,7,Fstatue's custodian and said it had been
OL,8,Fin contact with the street artist's
OL,9,Fteam. Banksy owns the copyright but the
OL,10,Fcouncil is responsible for the cost of
OL,11,Fkeeping the statue safe.
